  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A thin wand of black wood capped with a violet stone. Doors swing shut when it is carried through a house, and candles near it burn straight up without a flicker.</p><p><strong>Seal.</strong> The wand has 3 charges and regains them all at dawn. When you see a creature within 120 feet cast a spell, you can use your Reaction and expend 1 charge to make the spell fail, whatever its level. As an action, you can instead expend 1 charge to end every spell on one creature or object within 120 feet.</p><p><strong>A Vow Sealed.</strong> A vow sworn by two people with a hand each on the wand is sealed. If either breaks it, both know at once, wherever they are, and the breaker's hand shows the mark of the wand for a year and a day.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
